member.summary:
Clears all cache entries for the given plugin name.
When  is , all versions are removed;
otherwise only the specified version is evicted.

example.code:
// In Program.cs / Startup.cs:
services
    .AddToolsServices(configuration)
    .AddPluginServices(configuration);

var app = builder.Build();
app.Services.GetRequiredService<IPluginService>().LoadPluginsOnStartup();
